Z||000005||pherder||01-29-2000||02:38 PM||||MrFeeArrow,<P>Joe Wymann sells a kit with options (depending on what you already have and what you need) that is approx. $800 (before options).<P>Fierojo@bellatlantic.net is his email address.<P>He used to sell it thru the FOCOA.  He also sells a CD "book" on how to install a Longitudally mounted V8 into a Fiero.<P>Paul||||reg||4
